te text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            男鹿名物「石焼料理（いしやきりょうり）」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 木桶に入れた新鮮な魚介と味噌仕立ての出汁の中に、炭火で真っ赤に熱した男鹿の溶岩石（生き石）を一気に投入し、激しい湯気と共に瞬時に煮上げる豪快な伝統漁師料理です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            ユネスコ無形文化遺産「男鹿のナマハゲ」体験スポットは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 『なまはげ館』で150枚以上の多様なナマハゲ面を見学し、隣接する『男鹿真山伝承館』で大迫力のナマハゲ習俗実演を体感できます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            「男鹿温泉郷（おがおんせんきょう）」の泉質特徴は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 海水の成分に似た塩分を含むナトリウム塩化物泉で、入浴後に肌に塩分が付着して汗の蒸発を防ぐため『熱の湯』『美肌の湯』として体が芯から温まります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！秋田県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 秋田県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/akita-city-kanto-kiritanpo-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秋田市街おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秋田市（秋田駅前・中通・川反繁華街・千秋公園・秋田温泉）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/akita-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秋田おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秋田県全域（乳頭温泉郷田沢湖角館・男鹿半島・秋田市街・八幡平玉川温泉湯沢）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/hachimantai-tamagawa-goshogake-yuzawa-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】八幡平・玉川温泉・湯沢おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">仙北市北部・鹿角市・湯沢市（八幡平アスピーテライン・玉川温泉・後生掛温泉・秋ノ宮温泉郷・栗駒山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/nyuto-onsen-tazawako-kakunodate-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】乳頭温泉郷・角館おすすめ高級宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">仙北市（乳頭温泉郷・田沢湖畔・田沢湖高原・角館武家屋敷通り・抱返り渓谷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/aomori-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【青森県】【2026年最新】青森おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">青森県全域（奥入瀬渓流十和田湖・八甲田酸ヶ湯・弘前津軽・青森市街浅虫・八戸大間）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/iwate-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【岩手県】【2026年最新】岩手おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">岩手県全域（花巻温泉郷遠野・平泉一関・盛岡市街繋温泉雫石・三陸海岸宮古釜石）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/yamagata-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【山形県】【2026年最新】山形おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">山形県全域（銀山